        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As advised by our PRC Legal Advisor, we are responsible for compensation for personal injury and property damage caused by our product defects, but automobile manufacturers are the primary responsible parties for vehicle recalls under the PRC laws.",
